{
  "prose|call|A check runs its project's command for it: name the card too, so Hive knows the project": 1,
  "prose|call|A focused test's check is \"focused:<test>\", the test's id as its card lists it": 1,
  "prose|call|A revision is checked against what is checked out where the run runs: give folder too": 1,
  "prose|call|Nothing is checked out in {} to compare {} with: leave revision out": 1,
  "prose|call|Unknown card {}": 2,
  "prose|call|card is a card reference such as \"HI-12\" or \"#1061\": a plain number isn't taken (in a shell, quote \"#1061\": an unquoted # starts a comment)": 1,
  "prose|call|check is the name of one of the project's checks, such as \"typecheck\"": 1,
  "prose|call|folder is the absolute path of the folder the run runs in": 1,
  "prose|call|revision is a commit (its id, or a name git knows)": 1,
  "prose|call|{} has no command configured for the check \"{}\", so nothing was run. hive-progress --check runs the command the project's options give for that name": 1,
  "prose|call|{} has no revision to compare {} with: leave revision out": 1,
  "prose|call|{} holds {}'s revision, not {}'s: run it there for {}, or elsewhere for {}": 1,
  "prose|call|{} isn't a commit in {}": 1,
  "prose|call|{} isn't what's checked out here ({} is): check it out first, or leave revision out": 1,
  "prose|call|{} isn't {}'s revision now (its paths hash to {}): leave revision out": 1
}
